 CellID->519689844,ExpressionUUID->"1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],

Cell["\<\
The first check replays every declaration of the embedded module. The axiom \
lists are shown in addition to that replay. The statements printed below are \
Lean's own theorem types, including their exact premises and quantifiers.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1609367578,ExpressionUUID->"5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],

